      "priority": "P1",
      "title": "Migrate conformance digest formatting with sha2 0.11",
      "introducedAt": "crates/conformance/Cargo.toml:16",
      "description": "sha2 0.11.1 uses digest 0.11.3 whose Output aliases hybrid_array::Array. Unlike the prior generic-array digest, this Array has no LowerHex implementation. Ten unchanged conformance call sites format the entire digest with {:x}. Parent actual Cargo all-target check fails E0277, so these acceptance tests cannot compile.",
