        {
          "path": "crates/conformance/tests/support/mod.rs",
          "line": 225
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/conformance/tests/tokenizer_json.rs",
          "line": 14
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/conformance/tests/tokenizer_text.rs",
          "line": 21
        }
      ],
      "remediation": "Use a shared conformance SHA-256 formatter that emits each byte with two lowercase hex digits, replace all ten whole-digest LowerHex calls, retain every fixed expected digest, and verify empty/abc known digest controls and all-target compilation."
